avdk-overlay/components/bk_peripheral/src/dvp/dvp_ov9650.c
  OV9650 DVP sensor driver written for this project. Its structure follows
  Beken's dvp_ov2640.c from bk_avdk (Apache-2.0). The OV9650 register
  configuration it programs is the sensor configuration the shipped firmware
  of this doorbell uses, recovered from the device's own flash for
  interoperability with the sensor module fitted to the board.

